🔁 Alternate Approach (Without Extra Space)

Using Floyd’s Cycle Detection (Tortoise & Hare):

def isHappy(n):
    def next_num(num):
        return sum(int(d)**2 for d in str(num))

    slow = n
    fast = next_num(n)

    while fast != 1 and slow != fast:
        slow = next_num(slow)
        fast = next_num(next_num(fast))

    return fast == 1

Space: O(1)
Advanced but interview-friendly
